@M_KOJO_IRAI_TRIAL_OF_GUTS_K62(ROLE, SCENE, CLIENT_ID)
#DIMS ROLE     ;キャラの立場、依頼者かそうでないか
#DIMS SCENE    ;セリフの表示されるタイミング
#DIM  CLIENT_ID;依頼者IDだけ抜き出したもの
;--------------------------------------------------
;RETURN 0 の部分は共通の口上が表示されます
;依頼ごとの口上を表示する部分は RETURN 0 を RETURN 1 にしてください
;--------------------------------------------------
SELECTCASE SCENE
CASE "依頼提示時"
	PRINTL
	PRINTFORMDL Gensokyo is as peaceful as ever.
	PRINTFORMDL ...To be honest, you're a little bored.
	IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
		PRINTFORML 「My husband, you look bored.」
		PRINTFORML 「If it pleases you, please listen to Kaguya's suggestion.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Tonight's a splendid full moon. It is a wonderful time for a trial of guts.」

	ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕 || TALENT:思慕
		PRINTFORML 「Are you looking for a bit of excitement, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
		PRINTFORML 「I have a proposal for you, if you're interested.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Since tonight's a full moon, go undertake a trial of guts.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMW 「If you're that bored, since tonight's a full moon, go undertake a trial of guts.」
	ENDIF

	IF ABL:MASTER:戦闘能力 >= 5
		PRINTFORMDW A trial of guts? That doesn't sound all that scary.
	ELSE
		PRINTFORMDW A trial of guts? Given that this is Gensokyo, that might be quite terrifying indeed.
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼非受託時"
	IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
		PRINTFORML 「I understand. Then Kaguya will look for some other way to alleviate her husband's boredom.」
		PRINTFORML 「Perhaps you'd rather play with her, instead?」
		PRINTFORMDW Kaguya gives you a suggestive wink, as if to arouse you.
	ELSEIF TALENT:恋慕 || TALENT:思慕
		PRINTFORML 「That's a shame, but I won't force you. Perhaps some other time.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「I see, that's unfortunate.」
		PRINTFORML 「Perhaps I overestimated you.」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼受託時"
	PRINTFORMW 「Don't worry, when the real full moon is shining brightly tonight, come to the bamboo forest in the dead of night and see for yourself. You'll taste the true meaning of terror. It's wonderful.」
	PRINTFORMDL You're pretty motivated to find out just what Kaguya is planning now.
	PRINTFORMDL Being bored and spurred on by Kaguya, you decide to set out in the dead of night to undertake the trial of guts.
	PRINTFORMDL In the first place, Gensokyo is filled with such things like youkai and phantoms.
	PRINTFORMDW What could this extremely scary thing be?
	IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
		PRINTFORML （I hope you'll enjoy this as much as I do, my husband.）
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML （If you carry out the extermination, it'll be a real help for me.）
	ENDIF
	PRINTFORMD As the true full moon shines brightly onto the bamboo forest, fairies and youkai beyond your imagination run rampant.
	PRINTFORMDL 
	PRINTFORMDL This noisiness however isn't the trial of guts, but is instead youkai extermination.
	PRINTFORMW 「Now, the trial of guts. Let your guts shine through.」
	SIF TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 != 4
		PRINTFORMDW It was said that eating a mermaid's guts would make you immortal...

	CFLAG:1092 = 0 ;reset the flag for trial of guts result
	;ensure that the moon is visible
	TIME:5 = 0
	WIND_VELOCITY = 0
	FORBIDDEN_CHANGE_WEATHER = 1
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼確認時"
	PRINTFORMW 「Did you forget where you need to go? Just head for the Bamboo Forest of the Lost. You'll find what you're looking for soon enough.」
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼破棄時"
	IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
		PRINTFORML 「I understand. If you're no longer interested, then Kaguya will try to come up with something else instead.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「Did you lack the guts after all? That's a shame.」
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
CASE "依頼実行直前"
	;not relevant here
	RETURN 0
CASE "依頼実行直後"
	;not relevant here
	RETURN 0
CASE "成功報告時"
	IF CFLAG:1092 == 1 ;cannibalism
		IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
			PRINTFORML 「Did you enjoy your meal, my husband?」
			PRINTFORML 「Fufu, you need not worry. Kaguya will not judge you.」
			PRINTFORML 「Even the sight of my dear husband indulging in such an act must have been wonderful to behold.」
			PRINTFORML 「In trust, Kaguya is a little jealous of that girl for having seen such a sight.」
			PRINTFORML 「Perhaps Kaguya should-.」
			PRINTFORML 「Well, for now go on and enjoy your splendid victory in this trial of guts.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You should take pride in your courage.」
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Congratulations, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. This was a splendid victory.」
			PRINTFORMW 「Facing the terrors of the forest at night, defeating such a formidable foe...」
			PRINTFORML 「...And of course, a delicious meal at the end.」
			PRINTFORMDW Kaguya flashes you a terrifying smile.
			PRINTFORML 「It turned out that the scariest thing tonight was you.」
			PRINTFORMW 「You really are an interesting person.」
			PRINTFORMDL Kaguya gives you a respectful bow before leaving.
			PRINTFORMDW An ordinary person such as yourself could not fathom the actions and thoughts of an immortal alien.
		ENDIF
		CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(2, TARGET, 75)
		CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(4, TARGET, 50)
	ELSE
		IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
			PRINTFORML 「Did you have a good time playing with Mokou, my husband?」
			PRINTFORML 「No matter how often that girl is killed, she always returns soon afterwards, burning with the desire to destroy Kaguya.」
			PRINTFORML 「Truly, I could never tire of her.」
			PRINTFORMW 「I am glad that you enjoyed it as much as Kaguya does.」
			IF TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4
				CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(2, TARGET, 50)
				CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(4, TARGET, 30)
			ELSE
				CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(2, TARGET, 30)
				CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(4, TARGET, 20)
			ENDIF
		ELSE
			PRINTFORML 「Did you enjoy yourself, %CALLNAME:MASTER%?」
			PRINTFORML 「It's never boring when that girl is around.」
			PRINTFORML 「You performed admirably tonight, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. You've bested my trial of guts.」
			PRINTFORMDW Kaguya gives you a short applause before she leaves.
			CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(2, TARGET, 30)
			CALL CHANGE_CFLAG(4, TARGET, 20)
		ENDIF
	ENDIF
	RETURN 1
CASE "失敗報告時"
	IF TALENT:恋人 || (TALENT:妄信 && TALENT:MASTER:追加種族 == 4)
		PRINTFORML 「To think that Kaguya's husband would be defeated...」
		PRINTFORML 「You must be burning up with a desire for revenge against her.」
		PRINTFORML 「Let us both train even harder until there.」
	ELSE
		PRINTFORML 「So in the end it was your guts that ended up scattered about.」
		PRINTFORMW 「Well, I'm sure it was still plenty entertaining. You'll simply have to try again another time.」
	ENDIF	
	RETURN 1
;CASE "依頼報告不要"
;＜この依頼にはありません＞
;	RETURN 0
ENDSELECT

